    "description": "<p>You imbue a <strong>weapon</strong> with the cleansing energy of your spirit. Until this spell ends, all damage dealt by the <strong>weapon</strong> becomes <strong>light</strong>. If you have that <strong>weapon</strong> equipped while you cast this spell, you may perform a <strong>free attack</strong> with it as part of the same action.</p><p>This spell can only be cast on a <strong>weapon</strong> equipped by a willing creature.</p><hr><p><strong>Target Gains:</strong> @WEAPON[light]{Soul Weapon}</p>",
